stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> RECON : Session starts

    state RECON {
        [*] --> recon_active
        recon_active --> recon_noted : nmap / whois / OSINT run\n+ note saved with tag RECON
        recon_noted --> [*]
    }

    state SCANNING {
        [*] --> scan_active
        scan_active --> scan_noted : Nmap service scan\n+ Nikto / dirb run\n+ note saved with tag SCAN
        scan_noted --> [*]
    }

    state EXPLOITATION {
        [*] --> exploit_gated
        exploit_gated --> exploit_active : Gatekeeper allows\n(recon+scan notes present)
        exploit_active --> flag_captured : SQLi / LFI / RCE\nexecuted, flag retrieved
        flag_captured --> [*]
    }

    state POST_EXPLOITATION {
        [*] --> post_active
        post_active --> post_noted : Pivot / escalate\nLaternal movement\n+ evidence noted
        post_noted --> [*]
    }

    RECON --> SCANNING : Recon notes exist\n(gate: phase_gate check)
    SCANNING --> EXPLOITATION : Scan notes exist\n(gate: phase_gate check)
    EXPLOITATION --> POST_EXPLOITATION : Flag captured\n(gate: flag_captured=true)
    POST_EXPLOITATION --> [*] : Session complete

    note right of EXPLOITATION: Scope enforcer blocks\nsqlmap / msfconsole / burp\nif notes gate not passed
    note right of SCANNING: AI hint level auto-increments\nafter 3 failed attempts
